.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-billing-entities-update - Update a billing entity


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago billing-entities update  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint is used to update an existing billing entity


